AboutAbout
Santosh has a rich IT experience of 22 years. He is a well seasoned IT professional worked with global IT giants like Novell, IBM, Telstra & Wipro. He has been sphere heading various leadership roles and Propelling Growth in the global cloud business. 
As a Global head of cloud practice GCP , responsible for heading the presales organization, His expertise lies in setting up & leading a global cloud Practice, Presales leadership, building priority market solutions, driving training, certification, Competency, motivating and leading large teams winning deals. He has a fine blend of sales and technical background required to drive the Global presales organization. 
He has a rich experience in designing Pvt Public and Hybrid clouds. creating account level seeding and delivery strategies, designing globally relevant solution plays, creating technical artefacts, sphere heading client engagements , CXO discussions, client presentations, leading solution defense, leading formulating deal winning strategies. Coaching teams on public cloud, driving Training and certifications, Leading and Motivating teams, Bringing a cultural and behavioral change by creating healthy positive atmosphere leading to tangible outcomes.


Lead Cloud Consultant: Experienced in delivering consulting engagements to a large multinational organizations. This included IT strategies along with cost optimization; covering organization, application and technology rationalization and transformation. Delivering cloud amenability consulting engagements focused on cloud assessments, strategies, roadmaps together with the associated business cases. 

 Having worked for leading IT giants like he has vast experience in gamut of IT solutions right from Desktop solutions to VDI, Intel and Unix servers , Mainframes to super computers, network, storage arrays comprising of SAN/NAS models, end to end software solutions clubbed with IT consulting and managed services. 

He has had a lucrative career so far , responsible for large Marque wins, new logo acquisitions and as result been constantly elevated to leadership roles like Presales head, Consulting Lead, Branch head , Cloud Business Head , IT services leader and most recently as the Global Practice head for GCP. He has been a regular member of the Presidents club and a proud winner of 100 % club for consecutive years.